Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 07:39:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] Coverflow: triple tap glides back; dragging a card off
 the bottom sinks the song to the end

- empty space: a triple tap glides back to the playing song; a double tap there waits a moment for a
  third before it switches view
- a card dragged over the bottom edge sinks: random order moves it to the end of the shuffle plan
  (a queued song leaves the queue for it); list order drops it from the queue or moves the row to
  the playlist's end

